//RS /// Canonical JSON field names and wire-key shapes for one checked migration chain.
//RS ///
//RS /// The sema ShapeFact is the sole source of current per-field names. Historical
//RS /// names that are no longer present use the checked container `#RenameAll`
//RS /// transform, because their old field-level marker is no longer available.
//RS #[derive(Debug, Clone, PartialEq, Eq)]
//RS pub struct CanonicalMigrationShape {
